{"speciesId":409,"names":{"fr":"Charkos","es":"Rampardos","en":"Rampardos","ja":"ラムパルド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its powerful head butt has enough power to shatter even the most durable things upon impact."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its skull is as hard as iron. It is a brute that tears down jungle trees while catching prey."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its skull withstands impacts of any magnitude. As a result, its brain never gets the chance to grow."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its skull withstands impacts of any magnitude. As a result, its brain never gets the chance to grow."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand deux Charkos se rentrent dedans, leur crâne extrêmement épais les empêche de s’assommer."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Quand deux Charkos se rentrent dedans, leur crâne extrêmement épais les empêche de s’assommer."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"If two were to smash their heads together, their foot-thick skulls would keep them from fainting."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"À force de cogner son crâne pourtant hyper résistant, Charkos a un cerveau atrophié."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene sesos pequeños porque su duro cráneo, que soporta cualquier golpe, les impide desarrollarse."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its skull withstands impacts of any magnitude. As a result, its brain never gets the chance to grow."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"どんな 衝撃にも 耐えられる 分厚い 頭蓋骨に 押さえられて 脳みそは 大きく ならなかった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son crâne est dur comme du fer. Cette brute abat des arbres quand elle chasse sa proie dans la jungle."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su cráneo es duro como el hierro. Es tan bruto que destroza la jungla cuando persigue presas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its skull is as hard as iron. It is a brute that tears down jungle trees while catching prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"鉄のように 硬い 頭蓋骨。 ジャングルの 木々を なぎ倒し 獲物を 捕らえる 暴れん坊。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"À force de cogner son crâne pourtant hyper résistant, Charkos a un cerveau atrophié."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Tiene sesos pequeños porque su duro cráneo, que soporta cualquier golpe, les impide desarrollarse."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its skull withstands impacts of any magnitude. As a result, its brain never gets the chance to grow."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"どんな 衝撃にも 耐えられる 分厚い 頭蓋骨に 押さえられて 脳みそは 大きく ならなかった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Son crâne est dur comme du fer. Cette brute abat des arbres quand elle chasse sa proie dans la jungle."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Su cráneo es duro como el hierro. Es tan bruto que destroza la jungla cuando persigue presas."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its skull is as hard as iron. It is a brute that tears down jungle trees while catching prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"鉄のように 硬い 頭蓋骨。 ジャングルの 木々を なぎ倒し 獲物を 捕らえる 暴れん坊。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"À force d’enchaîner les coups de tête, sa calotte crânienne s’est épaissie. Son cerveau a donc dû rétrécir et il est plus petit que celui du Kranidos."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Debido a los continuos cabezazos que propina, su cráneo se ha vuelto más duro y grueso. Sin embargo, tiene menos sesos que Cranidos."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"The result of repeated headbutts is a skull grown thick and hard. However, its brain has shrunk in size compared with Cranidos’s."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"頭突きを 繰り返し 頭がい骨は 硬く 厚くなったが 脳味噌は ズガイドスより 縮んでいる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Des rapports font état d’un Charkos qui, après reconstitution et évolution, aurait pris la fuite en démolissant un gratte-ciel d’un coup de tête."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Corren historias de un Cranidos regenerado a partir de un fósil que, tras evolucionar, escapó y derribó un rascacielos de un cabezazo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Records exist of a revived fossil that evolved into Rampardos. It proceeded to escape and then destroy a skyscraper with a headbutt."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"復元され 進化した ラムパルドが 逃げだして 頭突きで 高層ビルを 破壊したという 記録が ある。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il y a bien longtemps, les hommes fabriquaient des casques plus solides que l’acier à partir de crânes de Charkos fossilisés."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Los hombres de antaño que encontraban restos fosilizados de Rampardos usaban su cráneo, más duro que el metal, para fabricar cascos."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"In ancient times, people would dig up fossils of this Pokémon and use its skull, which is harder than steel, to make helmets."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"大昔の 人は 化石を 掘り出し 鋼鉄 よりも 硬い 頭蓋骨で 兜を 作っていた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pokémon préhistorique célèbre pour ses coups de tête puissants et son petit cerveau, son extinction serait due à son extrême bêtise."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Pokémon prehistórico especializado en dar cabezazos. Una teoría atribuye su extinción a su cerebro pequeño y a su poca inteligencia."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"This ancient Pokémon used headbutts skillfully. Its brain was really small, so some theories suggest that its stupidity led to its extinction."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"頭突きが 得意な 古代のポケモン。 本当に 脳みそが 小さいので 愚かで 滅んだという説も ある。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Very little is known about its biology. Can knock down massive trees by smashing its beautiful, pearl-like crown against them."}],"varieties":[{"id":409,"moves":[{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",28],[23,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[25,"egg",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[25,"level-up",28]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[10,"tutor",0],[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[24,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0],[32,"train",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[8,"level-up",15],[9,"level-up",15],[10,"level-up",15],[11,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",15],[15,"level-up",15],[16,"level-up",15],[17,"level-up",15],[18,"level-up",15],[23,"level-up",15],[25,"level-up",15],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thra